  "id": "passion",
  "term": "passion",
  "definition": "In this context, passion means a person’s internalized motivation toward an activity. It is described in two forms: harmonious passion, which reflects more autonomous motivation and flexible self-regulation, and obsessive passion, which involves internal pressure and a more rigid pattern of persistence.",
